       yy--, ----sshheellll
           The column name will be modified to contain only characters allowed
           for shell variable identifiers. This is usable, for example, with
           ----eexxppoorrtt. Note that this feature has been automatically enabled for
           ----eexxppoorrtt in version 2.37, but due to compatibility issues, now it’s
           necessary to request this behavior by ----sshheellll.

